=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생으로서 3학기 이상을 등록한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자(학사경고 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 수학기간 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청학점 및 등록금 : 6학점 이내 / 학점당 금액은 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청서 제출 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">소속 학과</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">계명대</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016. 11. 21.(월) ~ 11. 22.(화)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 한국체대 2016. 11. 15.(화) ~ 11. 16.(수)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 타대학수학신청원(첨부파일)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">★ 추후 수강 신청 전 반드시 해당 학과 방문하여 본교의 성적 인정 교과목 확인 후 수강 신청 및 등록금 납부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 성적증명서</span> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 499.62pt; HEIGHT: 220.45pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 16pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">[개인정보 수집 안내]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 16pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">■ 관련근거 : 교육기본법 제16조 제2항, 고등교육법시행령 제73조 제2항 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">및 개인정보보호법 제15조 제1항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 개인정보 수집·이용 목적 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 대학간 학술교류협정에 따른 타대학생 학적 생성 기초자료 수집</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 개인정보 수집 항목 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 소속대학, 학과, 학번, 이름, 주민등록번호, 이메일주소, 연락처, 환불은행명 및 계좌번호</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 개인정보 보유 및 이용기간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 교육기본법 제23조의 3(학생정보의 보호원칙) 적용</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 기타 자세한 사항은 2016학년도 겨울계절수업 수학 안내(첨부파일) 참고 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTO